    <string name="detection_service_summary">Shows a send prompt when you copy a link</string>
    <string name="detection_service_description">Android doesn\'t tell apps when something is copied. Unofficial MonSender watches for the signs of a copy, such as a menu closing after a tap, a confirmation message, or the system clipboard preview, then briefly reads the clipboard to check for a link. It doesn\'t store or send screen content, and links only go to your MonLoader server when you swipe them up. Android may show a short notice when the clipboard is read.</string>

